  "sop_intro": "The three working rules of this board. The Indonesian text is the official one.",
  "sop1_t": "Daily card check.",
  "sop1_b": "Every working day, before going home, open My Board. For each card choose one: still in progress, stuck (write who you are waiting for), or done (attach proof). At most 3 cards in progress at once: finish one before starting a new one. Cards past their due date look wilted, then rotten.",
  "sop2_t": "Proof rule.",
  "sop2_b": "No proof, not done. Proof is a file, a photo, a signed document, or a link to a file. Examples: tax filing = the receipt; payment = the transfer slip; purchase = the receipt and a photo of the goods; letter or contract = the signed scan; report = the report file. The person who asked for the task checks the proof: Accept, or Ask for correction with the reason.",
  "sop3_t": "Friday Review.",
  "sop3_b": "Every Friday, 20 minutes. Only wilting, rotten and stuck cards and cards waiting for a director are discussed. Each card leaves with a new date and its reason, a new owner, or is cancelled. Fresh cards are not discussed. The aim is to see what is stuck and who needs help.",
